        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Biomolecules ke 4 MAJOR CLASSES hain:\n1️⃣ CARBOHYDRATES (Energy source - roti, rice)\n2️⃣ PROTEINS (Body building - muscle, hair)\n3️⃣ LIPIDS (Energy storage - ghee, oil)\n4️⃣ NUCLEIC ACIDS (Genetic material - DNA, RNA)\n\nYe classification BPSC aur SSC mein direct fact ke roop mein aata hai!"
