          "text": "MACROMOLECULES (Polymers - bahut saare units jud ke bane):\n✅ Polysaccharides (starch, cellulose)\n✅ Proteins\n✅ Nucleic Acids (DNA, RNA)\n✅ Lipids (kuch cases mein)\n\nMICROMOLECULES (Monomers - chhote building blocks):\n✅ Monosaccharides (glucose)\n✅ Amino acids\n✅ Nucleotides\n✅ Fatty acids"
