          "text": "Carbohydrates ke multiple functions hain:\n1️⃣ PRIMARY ENERGY SOURCE (glucose metabolism)\n2️⃣ STRUCTURAL SUPPORT (cellulose in plants, chitin in insects)\n3️⃣ ENERGY STORAGE (starch in plants, glycogen in animals)\n4️⃣ CELL RECOGNITION (glycoproteins on cell membrane)\n\nYe functional classification NEET mein bahut important hai!"
