      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "MONOSACCHARIDES = Simplest form of carbohydrates jo further hydrolysis (breakdown) nahi ho sakte. 'Mono' = one, 'saccharide' = sugar. Ye sweet taste wale, water-soluble, crystalline hote hain. Glucose, Fructose, Galactose - ye sabse important hain!"
        },
