          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Sir glucose to blood mein hota hai na? Fructose kahan milta hai?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Perfect recall! Glucose = blood sugar (brain ka fuel), Fructose = fruits mein (sabse sweet sugar!), Galactose = milk sugar ka part. Teeno ka molecular formula SAME hai - C₆H₁₂O₆ - lekin structure different! Isko kehte hain ISOMERS. BPSC ye zaroor puchta hai!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Hain?? Same formula but different? Ye kaise possible hai Sir? 😮"
