      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Bilkul! Biomolecules chemistry aur biology ek dusre se connected hain. DNA mein DEOXYRIBOSE sugar hota hai (5 carbon), RNA mein RIBOSE sugar (5 carbon). Dono pentoses hain! 'Deoxy' ka matlab hai 'one oxygen less'. Ye difference hi DNA ko stable banata hai!"
