        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Haan! NEET mein ye cross-concept questions aate hain. Ab ek aur important property - REDUCING SUGARS. Glucose, Fructose, Galactose sab reducing sugars hain. Matlab ye Benedict's test ya Fehling's test mein positive result dete hain!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Sir reducing sugar matlab kya hota hai exactly?"
