      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "REDUCING SUGAR = Jo sugar khud oxidize ho jaye (electron lose kare) aur dusre substance ko reduce kar de (electron de de). Iske liye FREE ALDEHYDE (-CHO) ya FREE KETONE (>C=O) group hona chahiye. Sabhi monosaccharides mein ye free group hota hai, isliye sab reducing hain!"
