        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Haan! Benedict's test ya Fehling's test mein copper sulphate (blue color) ko heat karte hain sugar ke saath. Agar reducing sugar hai, to BRICK RED PRECIPITATE (Cu₂O) banta hai. Blue se red - color change = positive test! Ye practical NEET aur BPSC dono mein important hai!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Wow! To lab mein easily identify ho jayega sugar! 😃"
