          "text": "Ab aate hain DISACCHARIDES pe! 'Di' = two. Ye 2 monosaccharide units ke jodne se bante hain. Jab 2 monosaccharides jud te hain, to ek WATER molecule (H₂O) nikal jata hai. Is reaction ko CONDENSATION REACTION ya DEHYDRATION SYNTHESIS kehte hain!"
