          "text": "Haan! Sucrose = common table sugar (chini). Ye sugarcane (ganna) aur sugar beet se milta hai. Molecular formula C₁₂H₂₂O₁₁ hai. Sabse interesting baat - Sucrose is a NON-REDUCING SUGAR! Yaani Benedict's test mein negative aayega!"
