          "text": "Brilliant confusion! Ye BPSC ka favorite trap hai! Jab glucose aur fructose jud te hain sucrose banane ke liye, DONO ke free aldehyde/ketone groups bond mein involve ho jate hain (glycosidic bond). Koi free group nahi bacha, isliye reducing property chali gayi!"
