          "text": "Perfect curiosity! Complementary base pairing! Purine (double ring) hamesha Pyrimidine (single ring) ke saath pair karta hai - taaki width consistent rahe (2 rings + 1 ring = 3 total). A-T-A-T galat hai (2+2=4), G-C-G-C bhi galat (2+2=4). Sirf A-T aur G-C = perfect 3-ring width!"
